flowchart TD
    User((New User))
    SignupForm[Signup Form]
    AuthService[Auth Service]
    UserDB[(User Database)]
    EmailService[Email Verification Service]
    ProfileWizard[Profile Setup Wizard]
    WelcomeService[Welcome Email Service]
    Dashboard[User Dashboard]
    AnalyticsService[Analytics Service]

    User -->|submits signup form| SignupForm
    SignupForm -->|create account| AuthService
    AuthService -->|store credentials| UserDB
    AuthService -->|send verification email| EmailService
    EmailService -->|deliver verification link| User
    User -->|clicks verification link| AuthService
    AuthService -->|redirect to| ProfileWizard
    ProfileWizard -->|save profile data| UserDB
    ProfileWizard -->|trigger| WelcomeService
    WelcomeService -->|redirect to| Dashboard
    Dashboard -->|log activity| AnalyticsService
